      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Input IDs -> Token Embeddings + RoPE",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Input IDs -> Token Embeddings + RoPE",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "26613af2-e20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 248,
      "width": 416.64,
      "height": 243.00000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#083344",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 70463,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Input: list[int] of length T (e.g. [892, 318, ...])\n\nEmbedding Matrix W_E (shape: |V| x d_model):\n\u2022 |V| = ~151,936 tokens (Qwen3 vocab size)\n\u2022 d_model = 1024 (hidden dimension in Qwen3-0.6B)\n\u2022 Each token ID i looks up row W_E[i] -> dense vector\n  x_t in R^{d_model} capturing semantic meaning.\n\nPositional Encoding \u2014 RoPE (Rotary Position Embedding):\n\u2022 Self-attention is permutation-invariant (bag-of-words)\n  without position info ('2 - 3' vs '3 - 2').\n\u2022 RoPE rotates Q and K vectors by angle m * theta_k\n  proportional to token position m.\n\u2022 Dot product Q_m . K_n depends ONLY on relative\n  distance (m - n), preserving sequence order.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Input: list[int] of length T (e.g. [892, 318, ...])\n\nEmbedding Matrix W_E (shape: |V| x d_model):\n\u2022 |V| = ~151,936 tokens (Qwen3 vocab size)\n\u2022 d_model = 1024 (hidden dimension in Qwen3-0.6B)\n\u2022 Each token ID i looks up row W_E[i] -> dense vector\n  x_t in R^{d_model} capturing semantic meaning.\n\nPositional Encoding \u2014 RoPE (Rotary Position Embedding):\n\u2022 Self-attention is permutation-invariant (bag-of-words)\n  without position info ('2 - 3' vs '3 - 2').\n\u2022 RoPE rotates Q and K vectors by angle m * theta_k\n  proportional to token position m.\n\u2022 Dot product Q_m . K_n depends ONLY on relative\n  distance (m - n), preserving sequence order.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
