      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A. RMSNorm + Causal Grouped-Query Attention (GQA)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. RMSNorm + Causal Grouped-Query Attention (GQA)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "39267534-596",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 585,
      "y": 294,
      "width": 427.8,
      "height": 217.35000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1b4b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 77537,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. RMSNorm: normalizes hidden state magnitude for\n   training/inference stability without mean centering.\n\n2. Linear Projections (Q, K, V):\n   Q = X * W_Q   (Queries: 'what am I looking for?')\n   K = X * W_K   (Keys:    'what info do I contain?')\n   V = X * W_V   (Values:  'what content do I pass?')\n\n3. Scaled Dot-Product + Causal Mask M:\n   Attention(Q,K,V) = Softmax( (Q * K^T)/sqrt(d_k) + M ) * V\n   \u2022 Causal Mask M sets future positions (j > i) to -\u221e\n     so token i NEVER peeks at future tokens!\n   \u2022 Multi-Head / GQA: multiple heads attend to syntax,\n     types, and numbers simultaneously, then concat.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. RMSNorm: normalizes hidden state magnitude for\n   training/inference stability without mean centering.\n\n2. Linear Projections (Q, K, V):\n   Q = X * W_Q   (Queries: 'what am I looking for?')\n   K = X * W_K   (Keys:    'what info do I contain?')\n   V = X * W_V   (Values:  'what content do I pass?')\n\n3. Scaled Dot-Product + Causal Mask M:\n   Attention(Q,K,V) = Softmax( (Q * K^T)/sqrt(d_k) + M ) * V\n   \u2022 Causal Mask M sets future positions (j > i) to -\u221e\n     so token i NEVER peeks at future tokens!\n   \u2022 Multi-Head / GQA: multiple heads attend to syntax,\n     types, and numbers simultaneously, then concat.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
