      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B. Residual Stream + SwiGLU Feed-Forward (MLP)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B. Residual Stream + SwiGLU Feed-Forward (MLP)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b5326437-b65",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1035,
      "y": 294,
      "width": 484.84,
      "height": 217.35000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1b4b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 40620,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Residual Connection (Skip Path):\n   H' = X + Attention(RMSNorm(X))\n   Prevents vanishing gradients & lets layers refine\n   a shared 'information highway' (residual stream).\n\n2. Position-Wise Feed-Forward Network (SwiGLU MLP):\n   H_out = H' + ( SiLU(H_norm * W_gate) * (H_norm * W_up) ) * W_down\n   \u2022 Runs independently on each token vector.\n   \u2022 Acts as a key-value factual memory bank (e.g.,\n     mapping 'add' + 'numbers' -> 'fn_add_numbers').\n\n3. Why O(T^2) Cost Without KV-Cache:\n   \u2022 SDK has no KV-cache -> every new token re-computes\n     Q, K, V across all T tokens (T x T attention matrix).",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Residual Connection (Skip Path):\n   H' = X + Attention(RMSNorm(X))\n   Prevents vanishing gradients & lets layers refine\n   a shared 'information highway' (residual stream).\n\n2. Position-Wise Feed-Forward Network (SwiGLU MLP):\n   H_out = H' + ( SiLU(H_norm * W_gate) * (H_norm * W_up) ) * W_down\n   \u2022 Runs independently on each token vector.\n   \u2022 Acts as a key-value factual memory bank (e.g.,\n     mapping 'add' + 'numbers' -> 'fn_add_numbers').\n\n3. Why O(T^2) Cost Without KV-Cache:\n   \u2022 SDK has no KV-cache -> every new token re-computes\n     Q, K, V across all T tokens (T x T attention matrix).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
