      "text": "3. Final RMSNorm -> LM Head -> Raw Logits",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Final RMSNorm -> LM Head -> Raw Logits",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3499ad27-575",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 248,
      "width": 401.76,
      "height": 259.20000000000005,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 87594,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Slice Last Token State h_T:\n   \u2022 Only the final vector h_T (shape [1, d_model]) is\n     needed to predict token T+1 (causal property).\n\n2. Unembedding / LM Head Linear Projection:\n   z = RMSNorm(h_T) * W_lm_head^T   (shape: [|V|])\n   \u2022 Projects d_model (1024) -> |V| (~151,936) scores.\n   \u2022 Often weight-tied with W_E (embedding matrix).\n\n3. Raw Logits Vector z (Returned by SDK):\n   \u2022 Unnormalized real numbers z_i in (-\u221e, +\u221e).\n   \u2022 Higher z_i = higher dot-product alignment with\n     token i's unembedding vector.\n\n4. Softmax (Conceptual \u2014 Skipped in Greedy):\n   P(i) = exp(z_i) / sum_j exp(z_j)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Slice Last Token State h_T:\n   \u2022 Only the final vector h_T (shape [1, d_model]) is\n     needed to predict token T+1 (causal property).\n\n2. Unembedding / LM Head Linear Projection:\n   z = RMSNorm(h_T) * W_lm_head^T   (shape: [|V|])\n   \u2022 Projects d_model (1024) -> |V| (~151,936) scores.\n   \u2022 Often weight-tied with W_E (embedding matrix).\n\n3. Raw Logits Vector z (Returned by SDK):\n   \u2022 Unnormalized real numbers z_i in (-\u221e, +\u221e).\n   \u2022 Higher z_i = higher dot-product alignment with\n     token i's unembedding vector.\n\n4. Softmax (Conceptual \u2014 Skipped in Greedy):\n   P(i) = exp(z_i) / sum_j exp(z_j)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
