      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. How to Recode encode(text) -> list[int] From Scratch",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. How to Recode encode(text) -> list[int] From Scratch",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c679e5e4-cd2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 758,
      "width": 736.56,
      "height": 291.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3b0764",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 29867,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1 \u2014 UTF-8 Bytes to BPE-Mapped String:\n  raw_bytes = text.encode('utf-8')\n  mapped_chars = [byte_to_unicode[b] for b in raw_bytes]   # e.g. ['\u0120', 's', 'u', 'm']\n\nStep 2 \u2014 Iterative BPE Merging (Exact Rank-Order Algorithm):\n  \u2022 If merges.txt is alongside vocab.json (same HuggingFace cache directory!):\n    - Load merge ranks: ranks[(pair_a, pair_b)] = rank_index (lower rank = merged first).\n    - Start with symbols = list(mapped_chars).\n    - Loop: find adjacent pair (symbols[i], symbols[i+1]) with minimum rank in ranks;\n      merge into symbols[i] + symbols[i+1]; repeat until no adjacent pair exists in ranks.\n  \u2022 Alternative Fallback (if using only vocab.json without merges.txt):\n    - Greedy Longest-Prefix Match (MaxMatch) over str_to_id keys (always terminates because\n      all 256 single-byte tokens exist in vocab.json!).\n\nStep 3 \u2014 Map Symbols to IDs + Special Tokens:\n  \u2022 token_ids = [str_to_id[sym] for sym in symbols]\n  \u2022 Handle ChatML control tokens explicitly (e.g. '<|im_start|>' -> 151644, '<|im_end|>' -> 151645)\n    before BPE splitting so special tokens aren't broken into characters!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1 \u2014 UTF-8 Bytes to BPE-Mapped String:\n  raw_bytes = text.encode('utf-8')\n  mapped_chars = [byte_to_unicode[b] for b in raw_bytes]   # e.g. ['\u0120', 's', 'u', 'm']\n\nStep 2 \u2014 Iterative BPE Merging (Exact Rank-Order Algorithm):\n  \u2022 If merges.txt is alongside vocab.json (same HuggingFace cache directory!):\n    - Load merge ranks: ranks[(pair_a, pair_b)] = rank_index (lower rank = merged first).\n    - Start with symbols = list(mapped_chars).\n    - Loop: find adjacent pair (symbols[i], symbols[i+1]) with minimum rank in ranks;\n      merge into symbols[i] + symbols[i+1]; repeat until no adjacent pair exists in ranks.\n  \u2022 Alternative Fallback (if using only vocab.json without merges.txt):\n    - Greedy Longest-Prefix Match (MaxMatch) over str_to_id keys (always terminates because\n      all 256 single-byte tokens exist in vocab.json!).\n\nStep 3 \u2014 Map Symbols to IDs + Special Tokens:\n  \u2022 token_ids = [str_to_id[sym] for sym in symbols]\n  \u2022 Handle ChatML control tokens explicitly (e.g. '<|im_start|>' -> 151644, '<|im_end|>' -> 151645)\n    before BPE splitting so special tokens aren't broken into characters!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
